description: Never attribute commits or PRs to Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor git attribution

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor agent trailer to commits or PR bodies.
- Commits and PRs must use the human author's identity only.
- If tooling injects a Cursor trailer, remove it before finishing the commit/PR.
